(text "PRE-REG ENTRY (bom 17(d)/(l)/(n), option B + per-branch V4P3 2026-10-xx): pre-reg rails enter on two SEAF-40 sites - J603 north-center carries the L-branches, J604 south-center the R-branches. Shared rails (one source, two destinations): P16A (+16.2 V -> +15 V-class POLs), N16A (-16.2 V -> N15A/VEE15), V8P3 (+8.3 V -> VE1). V4P3 is FIVE INDEPENDENT TPS7A4501 outputs on the PREREG sheet, never tied together: V4P3_LA -> V33CLK + P5A_L, V4P3_LB -> V33D + P5A_R, V4P3_LC -> V33FF_L (FF bank split per channel 2026-10-12), V4P3_RA -> V33FF_R, V4P3_RB -> V33RLY (bom 17o)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f9738f45-119e-44cf-82e2-0f3abc9ce172"))
