(text "Conn1/J506 = west, closest to FPGA; Conn2/J603 = north-center; Conn3/J604 = south-center. All three SEAF-40 sites are on the main-board bottom. Three SEAR interposers are BOM-only. Board separation target is 40 mm. Each pre-reg rail sits beside its own GND return; 10 uF local bulk per rail per connector - the heavy bulk/filtering lives on the pre-reg board. PWR_FLAGs are in the rails table on REFS_L." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 118.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b0f543c5-5598-4732-968a-f1f3617ccffd"))
(text "Conn1 only: V12SOM uses 30 contacts with a separate GND surround. V33_IF_IN uses four contacts with a carrier-GND guard and feeds the local 1.8 V LDO; it is not VAP_IO/GND_AP." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 136.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3fa6e723-c95e-467a-a10d-f2cde374416f"))
